  "title": "Apple Cider Beef Stew",
  "description": "In this savory stew, apple cider and sliced apple bring sweetness while cider vinegar adds tang to a one-pot meal made with beef, carrots, potatoes, and celery. Serve with a hearty, crusty bread.",
